# Spike build output — `go build ./...` inside a spike dir drops a binary
# beside its own source, and the spikes are committed reference material.
docs/spikes/*/admin-tui-desktop
docs/spikes/**/*.test

# admin-tui-desktop's Repo-tab frames render against whatever repo the dump
# process's cwd sits in, so a re-shoot always rewrites them (admin-3rgp.72.20).
# They are excluded from the reference set on purpose — the frozen,
# non-reproducible illustrations live in live-frames/ instead. See
# docs/spikes/admin-tui-desktop/live-frames/README.md.
docs/spikes/admin-tui-desktop/repo.txt
docs/spikes/admin-tui-desktop/repo-commits.txt
docs/spikes/admin-tui-desktop/repo-filter.txt
docs/spikes/admin-tui-desktop/repo-new-worktree.txt
docs/spikes/admin-tui-desktop/no-manifest.txt
